Custom file descriptors
-----------------------

The following file descriptor is for reading only

example:-
---------

"<"

exec 3 < input.txt

echo "Hello world" > input.txt

exec 3<input.txt

cat<&3

print's the output:- Hello world


The following file descriptor is for writing 

example:-
--------

">" 

exec 4>output.txt

echo New Text >&4
cat output.txt

The following file desciptor is for writing (append mode)

example:-
---------

">>"

exec 5>>appendMode.txt

echo help text >&5

cat appendMode.txt



